{"id":"n-20261005-hrksu","category":"fashion","display_title":"Miu Miu Blends Sportswear","display_title_he":"מיו מיו משלבת בגדי ספורט","short_summary":"Miu Miu presented its latest collection at Paris fashion week, cleverly merging everyday sportswear with high-fashion tailoring.","english_level":"C1","words":374,"reading_time":2,"image":null,"sources":[{"name":"The Guardian","domain":"theguardian.com","url":"https://www.theguardian.com/fashion/2026/oct/04/miu-miu-turns-real-clothes-into-high-fashion-with-sportswear-style","title":"Miu Miu turns ‘real clothes’ into high fashion with sportswear style","published_at":"2026-10-04T16:45:26.000Z"}],"published_at":"2026-10-04T16:45:26.000Z","first_published_in_app_at":"2026-10-05T19:25:24.135Z","quality_score":9,"interest_score":8,"verification_status":"verified","content_status":"published","paragraphs":["During Paris fashion week, the prominent luxury brand Miu Miu captured attention by transforming ordinary garments into high-fashion statements. According to Miuccia Prada, the creative vision behind the brand, the recent collection stemmed from pondering real clothes—the practical attire individuals wear for running daily errands rather than posing for social media platforms. Prada noted that contemporary dress reality involves a distinct mixture of sportswear, casual items, and normal wear, setting a creative challenge to elevate these elements into something more rich and intriguing.","The runway presentation opened with a series of neatly pleated checked skirts paired with brightly colored trainers instead of traditional pumps or loafers. Subsequent looks featured crop tops worn underneath checked blazers, while other outfits omitted the blazers entirely to highlight cropped silhouettes sitting just beneath the bust line. Later segments of the show introduced casual track pants matched with sophisticated knitwear and tailored jackets, alongside gym knickers given upgraded styling treatments. Furthermore, ordinary sports bras were reimagined as glittering party garments, and low-rise jeans created in collaboration with Wrangler utilized fastening mechanisms that riffed on shoelaces rather than standard buttons or belts.","Prada described this design methodology as nonconformist dialogues exploring friction and tension. This unique capability to clash clothing genres and subvert the ordinary has propelled Miu Miu toward immense commercial success, establishing it as a near-billion-euro brand. Originally launched in 1993 as a younger sister to Prada, the label currently holds the number two position on the Lyst index, which ranks brands based on consumer demand. Amid a challenging luxury market, the brand has sustained its momentum by understanding its distinct demographic, referred to as Miu Miu girls, who embrace an aesthetic described as slightly odd, messy, and perversely sexy.","The star-studded catwalk reflected this inclusive and unconventional archetype, featuring notable figures such as actor Emma Corrin in white knickers and a croc jacket, Olivia Colman wearing a cracked suede skirt suit, and Jamie Bell in low-rise Prince of Wales checked trousers alongside a two-tone vest top. Beyond the runway, Miu Miu continues to engage in cultural and athletic links, including a performance wear partnership with tennis star Coco Gauff, a popular literary club exploring works by acclaimed authors, and a long-standing initiative commissioning films directed by women."],"facts":[{"fact":"Miu Miu showcased its collection at Paris fashion week, featuring a mix of sportswear and real clothes.","sources":[1]},{"fact":"Miuccia Prada stated her focus was on everyday clothing and combining sports elements with sophistication.","sources":[1]},{"fact":"The runway included pleated checked skirts with trainers, track pants with tailored jackets, and sparkly sports bras.","sources":[1]},{"fact":"Celebrities such as Olivia Colman, Emma Corrin, and Jamie Bell walked in the show.","sources":[1]},{"fact":"Miu Miu ranks second on the Lyst index and has seen strong financial growth in a challenging luxury market.","sources":[1]}],"glossary":[{"text":"Paris fashion week","lemma":"Paris fashion week","pos":"name","he":"שבוע האופנה בפריז","name":true},{"text":"Miu Miu","lemma":"Miu Miu","pos":"name","he":"מיו מיו","name":true},{"text":"Prada","lemma":"Prada","pos":"name","he":"פראדה","name":true},{"text":"Wrangler","lemma":"Wrangler","pos":"name","he":"וראנגלר","name":true},{"text":"Lyst index","lemma":"Lyst index","pos":"name","name":true,"he":"מדד ליסט"},{"text":"Emma Corrin","lemma":"Emma Corrin","pos":"name","name":true,"he":"אמה קורין"},{"text":"Olivia Colman","lemma":"Olivia Colman","pos":"name","name":true,"he":"אוליביה קולמן"},{"text":"Jamie Bell","lemma":"Jamie Bell","pos":"name","name":true,"he":"ג'יימי בל"},{"text":"Prince of Wales","lemma":"Prince of Wales","pos":"name","name":true,"he":"פרינס אוף וויילס (דוגמת משבצות)"},{"text":"Coco Gauff","lemma":"Coco Gauff","pos":"name","name":true,"he":"קוקו גוף"},{"text":"during","lemma":"during","pos":"preposition","he":"במהלך","name":false},{"text":"prominent","lemma":"prominent","pos":"adjective","he":"בּוֹלֵט","name":false},{"text":"luxury","lemma":"luxury","pos":"noun","he":"יוֹקְרָה","name":false},{"text":"brand","lemma":"brand","pos":"noun","he":"מוּתָג","name":false},{"text":"captured","lemma":"capture","pos":"verb","he":"לָכַד","name":false},{"text":"attention","lemma":"attention","pos":"noun","he":"תְּשׂוּמַת לֵב","name":false},{"text":"transforming","lemma":"transform","pos":"verb","he":"מְשַׁנֶּה","name":false},{"text":"ordinary","lemma":"ordinary","pos":"adjective","he":"רָגִיל","name":false},{"text":"garments","lemma":"garment","pos":"noun","he":"בְּגָדִים","name":false},{"text":"into","lemma":"into","pos":"preposition","he":"לְתוֹךְ","name":false},{"text":"high-fashion","lemma":"high-fashion","pos":"adjective","he":"אוֹפְנַת עִלִּית","name":false},{"text":"statements","lemma":"statement","pos":"nou